# TF2's Cleaner's Carbine (specs/tf2/batch2b_mechanics.md 14, 18): its hits
# fill the crikey meter (the HUD's item meter), attack2 when full gives
# 8 s of mini-crits, and each mini-crit shows its yellow `minicrit_text`
# over the target. Needs the item pack (an asset store with `items`).
#   CHIMERA_ASSET_STORE=<store> cargo run --features dev --bin ultimate_gun_game -- --offscreen 1600x900 +volume 0 +sandbox \
#       --scene apps/ultimate_gun_game/scenes/tf2_crikey.scene --out <dir>
wait_for map_loaded 6000
wait_for spawned 3000
wait 120
god
sandbox ammo on
rung tf2:cleaners_carbine
target add tf2:tf_weapon_minigun 6
wait 2
wait_for idle 3000
wait 120
target look 1
+attack
wait 90
-attack
wait 10
shot crikey_meter
+attack
wait 300
-attack
wait 10
+attack2
wait 5
-attack2
wait 20
target look 1
shot_after hit 12 minicrit_text
+attack
wait 40
-attack
wait 60
